{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1775148517,"nonce":"p5wC0g+YaahuMSnAsaTZsyKYvck=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM76Fn47","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/37","origin":"github"},"title":"Configure BizzyBoat FCU GPS antenna offsets and verify GPS fix","message":"## Summary\n\nUpdate the BizzyBoat FCU (ArduPilot via mavros) GPS antenna offset parameters and verify proper GPS configuration.\n\n## Tasks\n\n1. **Set antenna offsets**: Configure the FCU with the correct GPS antenna position relative to the vehicle reference point. Reference geometry is documented in `bizzyboat_project11/docs/bizzyboat_reference_geometry.md`\n2. **Verify FCU GPS parameters**: Review the baseline parameter dump (`config/fcu/bizzyboat_fcu_baseline.param`) and ensure GPS-related parameters are correct (e.g., `GPS_POS1_X/Y/Z`, `GPS_TYPE`, `GPS_AUTO_CONFIG`)\n3. **Test GPS fix**: Launch core on gabby and verify mavros connects to the FCU and reports a GPS fix on `mavros/global_position/raw/fix`\n4. **NTRIP corrections**: Assess whether NTRIP should be enabled for RTK corrections (currently commented out in `launch/core_launch.py`)\n\n## Context\n\n- FCU connects via `/dev/fcu:57600` (udev symlink from `config/udev/99-bizzyboat.rules`)\n- Mavros timed out during previous core launch attempt (autopilot may not have been connected)\n- BizzyBoat is at the pier (not in water) — good opportunity to verify GPS fix\n- FCU baseline params captured in `config/fcu/bizzyboat_fcu_baseline.param`\n- URDF sensor positions defined in `urdf/sensors/gnss.xacro`\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.6`","files":null}]}